{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiners-2607-0233","content_id":"de89fa59-259d-460b-956b-0b6478d59ff7","description":"Product Recall for Ocun CONDOR HMS Triple Carabiners presenting a serious risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"debff08c-1b1b-40a8-9512-8366071bef33","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-29T08:48:44+01:00","id":"debff08c-1b1b-40a8-9512-8366071bef33","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-29T08:48:44+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a69b05c4dda8076771a42a5/2607-0233-product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiner.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Ocun CONDOR HMS Triple Carabiners</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk of serious injuries because the gate can malfunction and may not close automatically.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users by Fletcher Stewart.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Trekking/Mountaineering Sports Equipment</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td> Ocun </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>03550, 04106 (Hurry), 04716 (Bow), 04717 (Habu) </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch numbers</td>\n      <td>24003xx, 24004xx, 24010xx, 24023xx, 24024xx, 24025xx, 25005xx, 25006xx (found on spine of carabiner). Any products marked with * along the mentioned batch numbers are not part of the recall. </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturing and delivery</td>\n      <td>Between 20.11.2023 - 28.11.2025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Carabiner for rock-climbing and mountaineering.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_debff08c-1b1b-40a8-9512-8366071bef33\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a69b05c4dda8076771a42a5/2607-0233-product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiner.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk of serious injuries because the gate can malfunction and may not close automatically. This creates a risk of unintended detachment during use, which could result in a fall from height. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EU) 2016/425 on Personal Protective Equipment.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by Fletcher Stewart. We recommend that owners stop using the product immediately. Please visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.fletcherstewart.com/ocun-03550-product-recall\">https://www.fletcherstewart.com/ocun-03550-product-recall</a> to complete a recall form and arrange for a replacement.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2607-0233</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-29T07:53:19Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-29","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-29T08:53:19+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiners-2607-0233","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiners-2607-0233","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiners-2607-0233","content_id":"de89fa59-259d-460b-956b-0b6478d59ff7","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-29T07:53:19Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Ocun CONDOR HMS Triple Carabiners (2607-0233)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ocun-condor-hms-triple-carabiners-2607-0233","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are",